  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [preact-compat](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat) from `v3.17.0` to `v3.18.0`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v3.18.0`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/releases/3.18.0)\n\n- Implement `react-dom-factories` (#&#8203;456, thanks @&#8203;freeman)\n- Call `getDefaultProps` on the class so static properties are available (#&#8203;421, @&#8203;joeyrobert)\n- Fix cloned `props.children` issue (#&#8203;415, thanks @&#8203;kozak)\n- Fix IE11 lacking `Symbol.for()` (#&#8203;423, @&#8203;xxxiin)\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v3.18.0\n-   [`1a88d10`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/1a88d10af747e5f67620e4bd9412b577579c96ee) IE11 seems to define Symbol but without the method &#x27;for&#x27; (#&#8203;423)\n-   [`605b943`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/605b943e74b490a0fff11defd20ee3b29be8ca26) fix multi cloned element lose props.children bug (#&#8203;415)\n-   [`469e791`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/469e79186f97cf3c85d9d44369334ffa6b3333d3) update readme (#&#8203;413)\n-   [`5ca5748`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/5ca57489b75c539a0ad022f3624d97d755c939b5) Document usage with Brunch (#&#8203;386)\n-   [`1f0e508`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/1f0e5080b00b3c7c38ea2d0dd03fc0dec00c073f) Call getDefaultProps on the class so statics can be read (#&#8203;421)\n-   [`c6d5659`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/c6d5659f7bcba06b3eb4e486898581d33d576f1e) implement react-dom-factories (#&#8203;456)\n-   [`2f77d0a`](https://github.com/developit/preact-compat/commit/2f77d0ad8dd038b4515a2c42343d4b727ddd8c6c) 3.18.0\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
